{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-12-1","title":"1 Corinthians 12:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Spiritual gifts, 4 are diverse, 7 yet all to profit withal. 8 And to that end are diversely bestowed; 12 that by the like proportion, as the members of a natural body tend all to the mutual decency, 22 service, 26 and succour of the same body; 27 so we should do for one another, to make up the mystical body of Christ.</p>\n<p>spiritual. 4-11; 14:1-18,37; Eph 4:11 I would not. 10:1; 2Co 1:8; 1Th 4:13; 2Pe 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-12-2","title":"1 Corinthians 12:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>that. 6:11; Ga 4:8; Eph 2:11,12; 4:17,18; 1Th 1:9; Tit 3:3; 1Pe 4:3 dumb. Ps 115:5,7; 135:16; Hab 2:18,19 even. Mt 15:14; 1Pe 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-12-3","title":"1 Corinthians 12:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>no man. Mr 9:39; Joh 16:14,15; 1Jo 4:2,3 accursed. or, anathema. 16:22; De 21:23; Ga 3:13 no man. 8:6; Mt 16:16,17; Joh 13:13; 15:26; 2Co 3:5; 11:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-12-4","title":"1 Corinthians 12:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>there. 8-11,28; Ro 12:4-6; Eph 4:4; Heb 2:4; 1Pe 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-12-5","title":"1 Corinthians 12:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>administrations. or, ministries. 28,29; Ro 12:6-8; Eph 4:11,12 but. 8:6; Mt 23:10; Ac 10:36; Ro 14:8,9; Php 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-12-6","title":"1 Corinthians 12:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd"